{
  "_README": [
    "Copy this file to `spine.local.json` (same directory) and fill it in from the",
    "copy of the book you hold. `spine.local.json` is gitignored and must stay that",
    "way: a source's title together with its chapter-title table in reading order",
    "reconstructs that source's outline, which D-74 bans and D-10 makes a corpus",
    "rule. See DECISIONS.md, addendum 2026-08-31 under D-74 (owner ruling OD-6).",
    "Every value below is a placeholder. Fields: src = the XHTML file inside the",
    "extracted OEBPS directory; dest = the markdown file to write; type = one of",
    "chapter | part | epilogue; part = the enclosing part label or null; chapter =",
    "the book's own chapter number or null; title = the heading to write."
  ],
  "book": "<book title>",
  "author": "<author>",
  "source_epub": "<the .epub filename you hold>",
  "docs": [
    {
      "src": "introduction.xhtml",
      "dest": "01_ch01_introduction.md",
      "type": "chapter",
      "part": null,
      "chapter": 1,
      "title": "<title of chapter 1>"
    },
    {
      "src": "part001.xhtml",
      "dest": "02_part-1_<slug>.md",
      "type": "part",
      "part": "<part label>",
      "chapter": null,
      "title": "<part heading>"
    },
    {
      "src": "chapter001.xhtml",
      "dest": "03_ch02_<slug>.md",
      "type": "chapter",
      "part": "<part label>",
      "chapter": 2,
      "title": "<title of chapter 2>"
    },
    {
      "src": "epilogue.xhtml",
      "dest": "16_epilogue.md",
      "type": "epilogue",
      "part": null,
      "chapter": null,
      "title": "<epilogue heading>"
    }
  ]
}
